# Gate A re-check (Session 12): read a slab whose box strain was set by tools/rebox.py, apply surface forces, relax,
# and print the interior stress exactly as checks/04_pure_shear/in.block (same groups, same averaging, same minimiser).
# Vars: tag datain exx ezz sxy
variable        a equal 2.8553
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p s p
read_data       ${datain}
read_data       al_chi-29_tau1.0_it1.data
Reading data file ...
  triclinic box = (0 -0.005038004 0) to (24.725782 38.366076 27.939582) with tilt (0 -0.21681586 0)
